sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (browser)
    participant SPA as SiteTrack SPA
    participant SA as Supabase Auth
    participant Mail as Email inbox
    participant PG as Postgres + RLS
    participant Sen as Sentry (opt-in)

    U->>SPA: enter email + click "Sign in"
    SPA->>SA: signInWithOtp({email})
    SA->>Mail: send magic-link email
    SA-->>SPA: {ok:true}
    SPA-->>U: "Check your email" panel

    Mail->>U: shows link with code
    U->>SPA: click link  (loads sitetrackpro.in?code=…)
    SPA->>SA: exchange code → session JWT
    SA-->>SPA: JWT {sub, email, app_metadata.tenant_id, role}

    SPA->>SPA: localStorage["sb-…-auth-token"] = JWT
    SPA->>SPA: Sentry.setUser({id, role, org_id})
    SPA->>SPA: hydrate state via usePersistent (subscribes to Supabase tables)
    SPA->>PG: GET /projects?select=* (with JWT)
    PG->>PG: RLS sets app.tenant_id from JWT
    PG-->>SPA: only this tenant's rows
    SPA-->>U: dashboard renders

    opt Any error
        SPA->>Sen: captureException (scrubbed)
    end
